## 6. 附件上传规范

### 6.1 上传组件
```vue
<el-upload
  :action="uploadUrl"
  :on-success="(res) => handleUploadSuccess(res, '{subCode}', '{fileType}')"
  :file-list="fileList.{subCode}.{fileType}"
  multiple
>
  <el-button type="primary">点击上传</el-button>
</el-upload>
```

